+and stand here word for word. This page, the recount and the lock were put together from them by the building
+session, under the direction entered as register row P-832; main lands the arc after its own check. The review's
+entry is in `docs/progress/REVIEWS.md`; this arc holds its evidence. 0 of 19.*
